# The per-fridge shopping list (API.md §7). Sign in first with dev-login (see fridges.http).
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5105/api/v1
@fridgeId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@itemId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@productId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### The list (unchecked first, then by category, then by name)
GET {{baseUrl}}/fridges/{{fridgeId}}/shopping-list

### Add entries; a product with an unchecked entry is merged (amounts summed, null + x = x)
POST {{baseUrl}}/fridges/{{fridgeId}}/shopping-list/items
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: fetch

{ "items": [
  { "productId": "{{productId}}", "text": null, "amount": 500 },
  { "productId": null, "text": "Chleb", "amount": null }
] }

### Check off (version from the last read; 409 concurrency.conflict when stale)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/fridges/{{fridgeId}}/shopping-list/items/{{itemId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: fetch

{ "version": 0, "checked": true, "amount": null, "text": null }

### Remove an entry
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/fridges/{{fridgeId}}/shopping-list/items/{{itemId}}
X-Requested-With: fetch

### Move checked entries to the fridge (package = amount or product default, at 100 %) and remove them
POST {{baseUrl}}/fridges/{{fridgeId}}/shopping-list/complete
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: fetch

{ "moveToFridge": true }
